Climate and Migration on German Political Party YouTube
A Corpus with Stance, Propaganda, and Divisiveness Annotation

Copyright (c) 2026 Zaher Alkaei, Manfred Stede, Christoph Maximilian Abels
University of Potsdam

This repository contains three kinds of material, covered by different terms.
Please read all three sections.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. ANNOTATIONS AND DERIVED DATA  --  CC BY-NC 4.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The annotation layers we created, and every file derived from them, are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license
(CC BY-NC 4.0). This covers:

  - interaction-quality scores and labels
  - parent and child stance labels
  - propaganda-technique label sets
  - thread-level aggregate scores and quality bins
  - the annotation guidelines, system prompts and few-shot sets
  - the inter-annotator agreement, evaluation and topic-validation reports
  - topic assignments and all aggregate statistics

You may share and adapt this material for non-commercial purposes, with
attribution. Full license text:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
  Summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

