-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. UNDERLYING COMMENT AND VIDEO TEXT  --  NOT OURS TO LICENSE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The comment text, video titles and transcript material in this repository were
posted by third parties on YouTube. Copyright in that content remains with its
respective authors. We do not and cannot grant any license over it. It is
redistributed here in pseudonymized form for non-commercial academic research
only, and its use remains subject to the YouTube Terms of Service and to
applicable law, including the research exceptions of the EU DSM Directive
(Art. 3) and German UrhG Sec. 60d.

All author names have been replaced with sequential pseudonyms
(User_00001, User_00002, ...), including inside @-mentions. No usernames,
handles, channel subscriber identities or author profile metadata are included.
Do not attempt to re-identify comment authors, and do not use this material to
target, profile or contact any individual.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REMOVAL REQUESTS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you are the author of a comment included in this corpus and you want it
removed, or if you have any other concern about the data, write to:

  alkaei@uni-potsdam.de

Please quote the pair identifier (PairID) if you have it, or the comment text.
We will remove the record and publish an updated release.

